          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "রসগোল্লা (rôsôgollā) is rôs, \"juice, syrup\", Sanskrit rasa, + gollā, \"ball\", which belongs with Bengali golā, \"ball\", from Sanskrit gōla (CDIAL 4321)."
